{"title":"Kundalini Yoga + 5-element chimes sound bath","startsAt":"2026-10-10T10:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-10T11:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Class description: Gentle outdoor yoga + 5-element chime meditation (attune, align, release). All levels welcome. Bring a mat and water. By donation.\n\nFind us by the tennis courts.\n\nShort bio:\n\nSinique is the founder of Yakuna Path, a somatic wellness practice that guides you back into relationship with your body and the natural world. She weaves breath, movement, sound, and elemental wisdom into every session. Her outdoor classes blend gentle yoga with a short 10-15 minute-element chime meditation — a simple way to attune, align, and release. Expect to leave feeling grounded, softer in your body, and more present in your day.","venue":{"name":"Oriole Park","address":"201 Oriole Parkway, Toronto","lat":43.697491,"lng":-79.40274,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Yoga in Nature Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/0/c/d/highres_534320685.jpeg"}